EXTERNAL runEvent(eventId)

Molok: Your shadow... it fell across my dreams long before you arrived.

Cacildes: What are you supposed to be?

~ runEvent("Show Molok Camera 2")

~ runEvent("Hide Molok Camera 1")

Molok: I am the last echo of Molok, god-king of Nargün. This stone is my prison... and my pyre.

~ runEvent("Hide Molok Camera 2")

~ runEvent("Show Cacildes Camera 1")

Cacildes: This stone... The elves of Arun have asked me to protect it... what should I do?

~ runEvent("Show Molok Camera 1")

~ runEvent("Hide Cacildes Camera 1")

Molok: The elves... ah yes. They've grown fat on the marrow of my anguish.
<> Each spell they weave... each tree that grows... it devours another piece of my soul.

Molok: But my children... the orc-clans... they stumble blind through endless night.
<> No dreams. No hope. No god to light their way.

~ runEvent("Hide Molok Camera 1")

~ runEvent("Show Molok Camera 2")

Molok: You hold the key to my chains, mortal.
<> Break this stone. Let me return to my people before they fade to nothing.

~ runEvent("Hide Molok Camera 2")

Cacildes: I didn't come here to free ancient gods. I just want to find my way home.

~ runEvent("Show Molok Camera 2")

Molok: Then we want the same thing. Strike me down, shatter my bonds, and the path home opens for us both.
<> Only a true fight will shatter the stone and set us free... do you understand?

~ runEvent("Hide Molok Camera 2")

Cacildes: Yes. I think I do.
